# Notes for the operator:
#   - Real Mifare 1K cards have a unique UID; this template uses
#     a fake 04:DE:AD:BE. Use it to test that the Flipper
#     emulator + an NFC reader handshake works, NOT to bypass
#     access control on third-party systems.
#   - Validation: python ..\scripts\verify_flipper_files.py
#   - Data tests: python ..\scripts\test_flipper_payloads.py
